# Overture: what a first visit performs, about fourteen seconds, no model call.
# A calm welcome in the language itself. First a small drawing made as Claude
# would make it (a question typed, 64 split in two, the half written with the
# pen) while the first words play; then it gives way to one line that says what
# Conduit is and seven starters that reach across lessons, diagrams, dashboards,
# mock-ups, pages, music and explorables. The settled state is that line and the
# starters together. A starter's text is what is sent to the model when it is
# tapped, so each is a prompt that has been run live. It sets no look of its
# own: it is drawn in whichever look the person has, with colour roles only, so
# paper and night both hold.

scene draw free calm align=center canvas=square
group g
rect in=g composer 4,12 92x14 r=7 stroke=dim thick=0.8 dur=0.5s
say in=g prompt at=50,19 enter=type | Show me half of 64
wait 0.3
say in=g total at=50,36 size=xl | 64
rect in=g whole 6,42 88x28 stroke=ink thick=1.2 dur=0.8s
line in=g cut 50,42 50,70 stroke=ink thick=1.2
say in=g q at=28,56 size=xxl ink=accent | ?
wait 0.4
drop q
path in=g three stroke=accent thick=3 dur=0.7s | M12 48 C23 43 29 51 20 55 C30 56 28 66 12 63
path in=g two stroke=accent thick=3 dur=0.6s | M31 50 C32 44 44 44 43 51 C42 56 37 59 31 64 H46
wait 0.2
say in=g yes at=50,85 size=xl enter=slam | 32!
wait 0.9

scene hello stack brisk lines=3 align=center
say size=l enter=fade dur=0.5s | Ask anything. The answer arrives as a drawing you can tap, drag and talk back to.
wait 0.4
say size=m enter=fade dur=0.4s | Try one:
wait 0.2
say choice size=m @13 enter=fade dur=0.3s | Teach my 7-year-old division
say choice size=m @13 enter=fade dur=0.3s | Explain how a heat pump works
say choice size=m @13 enter=fade dur=0.3s | Mock up a dashboard of Apple's fiscal 2025 results
say choice size=m @13 enter=fade dur=0.3s | Mock up an app screen
say choice size=m @13 enter=fade dur=0.3s | Render me a real webpage for a small coffee roaster
say choice size=m @13 enter=fade dur=0.3s | Make a little piano I can play
say choice size=m @13 enter=fade dur=0.3s | Let me explore how compound interest grows with the rate
